G-A-M-E-R-S

455
01:05:25,388 --> 01:05:28,188
G-A-M-E-R-S

456
01:05:37,688 --> 01:05:38,488
フブキ！
Fubuki!

457
01:06:02,288 --> 01:06:03,288
3, 2, 1, Go!

458
01:06:54,388 --> 01:06:57,188
G-A-M-E-R-S

459
01:06:59,388 --> 01:07:02,288
G-A-M-E-R-S

460
